  "fileName": "Delivery Bridge - Solution Design",
  "diagramDescription": "Operational workflow connecting business referents and developers for visibility, team performance and work quality. Conceptual portfolio solution design using a neutral project name; not an as-built company deployment inventory. Every component description identifies its evidence basis. All detailed models, sources, rules, interfaces and AI capabilities require project validation. AIT analyser is interpreted as AIP Analyst. Generic custom cards represent tools whose native type was not present in the supplied example. No live resource RIDs. Connections show data, invocation, navigation or governance relationships as labelled.",
